		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG">
			<Text>Commando I (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG_HELP">
			<Text>This Great General is a general who specializes in ambush and sneak tactics.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG2">
			<Text>Commando II (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG2_HELP">
			<Text>This Great Experienced General with his addition of specializing in ambush tactics, he or she has also studied guerrilla warfare. Replaces [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Commando I[ENDCOLOR].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG3">
			<Text>Commando III (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_GG3_HELP">
			<Text>This Great Veteran General is known for his or her flexibility of battle tactics. Some of the tactics are renown for their sudden appearance with one army appearing out of a forest and then disappearing once again. Replaces [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Commando III[ENDCOLOR].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO">
			<Text>Commando I</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO_HELP">
			<Text>+50% Flank Attack Modifier. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Commando I[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO2">
			<Text>Commando II</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO2_HELP">
			<Text>+50% Flank Attack Modifier. +25% [ICON_STRENGTH] Combat Strength when fighting in [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]ROUGH[ENDCOLOR] terrain. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Commando II[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO3">
			<Text>Commando III</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COMMANDO3_HELP">
			<Text>+50% Flank Attack Modifier. +25% [ICON_STRENGTH] Combat Strength when fighting in [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]ROUGH[ENDCOLOR] terrain. No penalty when attacking from rivers or water. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Commando III[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
